just because it's in tension in that way is holding itself together, that's what he said early on. So instead of a self-supporting spiral, they use something called web walls. Look at the floor across from you. Those thin walls that you see that jut out from floor to ceiling, those are actually all connected. Those are the web walls. They hold this whole building together. These vertical walls, which extend all the way up into the Oculus, the combination of all of those together is the structural skeleton of the building, everything else hangs off of it.
因此，他们没有采用自支撑螺旋，而是使用了一种叫做“网墙”的东西。看看你对面的地板。你看到的那些从地板延伸到天花板的薄墙，其实都是连在一起的。那些就是网墙。它们将整座建筑维系在一起。这些垂直的墙壁一直延伸到天窗（Oculus）中，所有这些墙壁的组合就是建筑的结构骨架，其他一切都悬挂在它上面。

